						 <div class="info-container"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div> <p><strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shineshadowd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3967806&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605860216" alt="ShineShadowD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3967806)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shineshadowd" >ShineShadowD</a></span><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> <hr /> <div id="u-author_block"> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/shineshadowd">▸ More by this Author ◂</a></p> <hr /></div> <div class="translation_block"> <h1><span>Translations:</span></h1> </div> <div class="u-faq"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/component:info-ayers">F.A.Q.</a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <h1><span>So,are you confused because there isn't <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/component:anomaly-class-bar">ACS</a> icons you want to use?</span></h1> <h3><span>Hei ! Here are m-o-r-e Secondary Class icons.</span></h3> <hr /> <h2><span>How to use them in Esoteric Classes ?<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-618803-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup></span></h2> <h3><span>Remember to use lowercase letters,bro.</span></h3> <div class="help"> <blockquote> <p>Beginning of include ↦</p> <p>Item # of SCP ↦</p> <p>Clearance Level <em>USE DIGITS (5,4,3,2,1,0)</em> (<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/anomaly-classification-system-guide">See guide here</a>)↦</p> <p>Container Class (Also known as Object Class) ↦</p> <p>OPTIONAL Secondary Class (If Using, set Container Class to <em>Esoteric</em>) ↦</p> <p>If secondary class is used, place URL to Class Icon here ↦</p> <p>Disruption Class (<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/anomaly-classification-system-guide">See Guide</a> &amp; Read Below for Explanation) ↦</p> <p>Risk Class (<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/anomaly-classification-system-guide">See Guide</a> &amp; Read Below for Explanation) ↦</p> <p>End of include ↦</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><tt>[[<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">include</span> :scp-wiki:component:anomaly-class-bar-source</tt></p> <p><tt>|item-number= XXXX</tt></p> <p><tt>|clearance= #</tt></p> <p><tt>|container-class= euclid</tt></p> <p><tt>|secondary-class= none</tt></p> <p><tt>|secondary-icon= <a href="http://urlhere.com">http://urlhere.com</a></tt></p> <p><tt>|disruption-class= vlam</tt></p> <p><tt>|risk-class= warning</tt></p> <p><tt>]]</tt></p> </blockquote> </div> <hr /> <h2><span>Examples</span></h2> <h3><span>It looks interesting.</span></h3> <div class="anom-bar-container item-XXXX clear-5 esoteric gevurah ekhi critical {$american}"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item">Item#:</span> <span class="number">XXXX</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level">Level5</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category">Containment Class:</div> <div class="class-text">esoteric</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category">Secondary Class:</div> <div class="class-text">gevurah</div> </div> </div> <div class="disrupt-class"> <div class="class-category">Disruption Class:</div> <div class="class-text">ekhi</div> </div> <div class="risk-class"> <div class="class-category">Risk Class:</div> <div class="class-text">critical</div> </div> </div> <div class="diamond-part"> <div class="danger-diamond"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/classification-committee-memo">link to memo</a><br /> <div class="arrows"></div> <div class="octagon"></div> <div class="quadrants"> <div class="top-quad"></div> <div class="right-quad"></div> <div class="left-quad"></div> <div class="bottom-quad"></div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="anom-bar-container item-YYYY clear-3 esoteric maksur dark warning {$american}"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item">Item#:</span> <span class="number">YYYY</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level">Level3</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category">Containment Class:</div> <div class="class-text">esoteric</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category">Secondary Class:</div> <div class="class-text">maksur</div> </div> </div> <div class="disrupt-class"> <div class="class-category">Disruption Class:</div> <div class="class-text">dark</div> </div> <div class="risk-class"> <div class="class-category">Risk Class:</div> <div class="class-text">warning</div> </div> </div> <div class="diamond-part"> <di