div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <h2><span>Here are the icons you want !</span></h2> <h3><span>The extra icons are all self-drawn, and the basic icons are inherent to ACS.</span></h3> <h3><span>Classification and footnotes Refer to <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/esoteric-classes-complete-list">A Comprehensive List of Esoteric Classes</a></span></h3> <h6><span>Update from time to time, mainly based on &quot;Established Esoteric Classes&quot;.</span></h6> <div class="step_container"> <h1><span>Extra ACS Icons</span></h1> <div class="icons"> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-white"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/shineshadowd:gyd4/Cernnunos.svg" alt="Cernnunos.svg" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">Cernnunos<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-618803-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup></div> <div class="icon_link"><a href="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/shineshadowd:gyd4/Cernnunos.svg">Link</a></div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-white"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/shineshadowd:gyd4/Chhokmah.svg" alt="Chhokmah.svg" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">Chhokmah<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-618803-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >3</a></sup></div> <div class="icon_link"><a href="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/shineshadowd:gyd4/Chhokmah.svg">Link</a></div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-white"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/shineshadowd:gyd4/Continua.svg" alt="Continua.svg" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">Continua<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-618803-4" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >4</a></sup></div> <div clas