le! I really hope you liked it! ( and If you want to edit this, you can! im open to changes.)]</div> </div> <br /> <sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-228937-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5128">SCP-5128</a> | SCP-5129 | <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5130">SCP-5130</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cole-13" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6984611&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605860223" alt="Cole 13" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6984611)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cole-13" >Cole 13</a></span></p> 
