&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;[PJEET]&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Okay so far. Thero&#039;s getting suited up. ⌠&lt;em&gt;distant&lt;/em&gt;⌡ Thero, you want to say anything to Darcy?&lt;/td&gt;
